        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Faust",
        "text": "The two of us, lone crossbowmen. If we both pull the trigger at the same time, we both die."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Faust",
        "text": "What's your name?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_367_swllow_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat",
        "text": "Codename GreyThroat. When did you get behind me?"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
            "name2": "char_367_swllow_1",
            "fadetime": 1,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 2
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
            "name2": "char_367_swllow_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Faust",
        "text": "The third time you blinked."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Faust",
        "text": "You're pretty direct..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
            "name2": "char_367_swllow_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat",
        "text": "You've been separated from your squad. I'm not here to kill people who don't want a fight."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
            "name2": "char_367_swllow_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Faust",
        "text": "We're enemies."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
            "name2": "char_367_swllow_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat",
        "text": "Rhodes Island is here to save the Infected. I saw you helping them."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
            "name2": "char_367_swllow_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Faust",
        "text": "Those were my comrades. You're my enemy."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Faust",
        "text": "When did Rhodes Island hire someone so naive?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
            "name2": "char_367_swllow_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat",
        "text": "Yes, I'm naive. All I can do is follow orders. I freeze up whenever I have to make a decision for myself."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
            "name2": "char_367_swllow_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Faust",
        "text": "You need to be careful."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
            "name2": "char_367_swllow_1#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat",
        "text": "Watch your finger!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat",
        "text": "That's a single shot crossbow. If I dodge your bolt, you're dead. Don't pull that trigger."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
            "name2": "char_367_swllow_1#4",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Faust",
        "text": "If you only follow orders, if you rely on everyone else to tell you what to do, that can only end poorly."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
            "name2": "char_367_swllow_1#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat",
        "text": "Why?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
            "name2": "char_367_swllow_1#4",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Faust",
        "text": "Most of the sheep who blindly take orders aren't actually dependent on anyone. They just haven't started thinking for themselves..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Faust",
        "text": "And those who have no direction in life, they're just empty machines looking for a sense of accomplishment, and meaning."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Faust",
        "text": "You activate, and perform your function, you input a goal, you achieve your goal, until you consume everything around you, and you consume those you serve."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
            "name2": "char_367_swllow_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat",
        "text": "I won't."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
            "name2": "char_367_swllow_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Faust",
        "text": "You're inexperienced."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
            "name2": "char_367_swllow_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat",
        "text": "I saw your interaction with the Infected back there. You're doing the right thing."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
            "name2": "char_367_swllow_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Faust",
        "text": "Your opinion means nothing to me."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
            "name2": "char_367_swllow_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat",
        "text": "Faust, you've been avoiding the L. G. D. Even the ones who are out here on their own, you haven't shot at them. I've been watching you."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
            "name2": "char_367_swllow_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Faust",
        "text": "Don't take my patience for weakness. If I ambushed you, you'd be dead."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
            "name2": "char_367_swllow_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat",
        "text": "But you didn't."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat",
        "text": "You're exhausted. Take it from a crossbowman, your string is drawn too tight. It's definitely going to snap."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
            "name2": "char_367_swllow_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Faust",
        "text": "Take it from a crossbowman, you're too much."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
            "name2": "char_367_swllow_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat",
        "text": "You've also seen those... special Infected. We can figure this one out together."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
            "name2": "char_367_swllow_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Faust",
        "text": "Maybe you're right."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
            "name2": "char_367_swllow_1#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat",
        "text": "Wait!"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 0.7
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "fadetime": 1,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Faust",
        "text": "But there's nothing I can do."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_367_swllow_1#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat",
        "text": "(He disappeared the instant he moved...? I can't figure his position!)"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_367_swllow_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat",
        "text": "......hm?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat",
        "text": "Why haven't you killed me?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Faust",
        "text": "You didn't shoot. Neither will I."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Faust",
        "text": "But next time? If you don't kill me, I will kill you."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_367_swllow_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat",
        "text": "I don't want to hurt you!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Faust",
        "text": "That's too bad."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Faust",
        "text": "I guess you need someone to answer you. Without an answer, you can't understand."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Faust",
        "text": "Don't worry about it. Killing, dying, these are everyday facts of life. Even for Rhodes Island."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_367_swllow_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat",
        "text": "Why can't we work together to save them?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Faust",
        "text": "I really wish I could. But I know I can't."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Faust",
        "text": "Don't follow me."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Faust",
        "text": "You still don't know them. You don't yet have the whole picture."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Faust",
        "text": "...and me? There's nothing I can do anymore."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 1,
            "r": 0,
            "g": 0,
            "b": 0,
            "fadetime": 1,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
